      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8163215::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial PtPdRhRuIrOs catalyst is nanoscale, equimolar, and a solid solution.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8163215::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC7595151::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-synthesized PtPdRhRuIrOs catalyst has intrinsic local lattice distortions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7595151::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Atomic-size differences among high-entropy-alloy components can cause lattice distortion.",
      "field": "supporting_evidence",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7595151::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized lattice distortion governs ethanol-oxidation activity and product selectivity in PtPdRhRuIrOs.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10774414::web::006::gaussian_distribution_of_gh_on_ptfeconic",
        "PMC7595151::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lattice strain shifts the d-band center and thereby changes adsorbate binding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10774414::web::006::gaussian_distribution_of_gh_on_ptfeconic"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intrinsic distortions create adsorption energies that are optimal for ethanol and its key intermediates.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10774414::web::006::gaussian_distribution_of_gh_on_ptfeconic",
        "PMC7595151::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at 400 °C for 3 hours in an inert atmosphere will selectively relieve local strain in PtPdRhRuIrOs.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealing treatment can relieve strain without significant particle coarsening or morphological change.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing-induced strain relief will produce a measurable downshift or other alteration of the d-band center.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10774414::web::006::gaussian_distribution_of_gh_on_ptfeconic"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealing-induced d-band change will make ethanol and intermediate adsorption less optimal.",
